    At head f2b8b6d the measurement reports main_commits 304 while git rev-list --count origin/main is 1319;
    304 is exactly 'git log --since=24 hours ago | wc -l', reproducible to the unit. The field is named and
    placed as if it described main's history, and it shrinks while the head is unchanged, which reads as lost
    commits. The same payload already labels its agents window (window_seconds 86400); the git block does not.
    
