    falsifier, assigned to the Executive for the script and the Judiciary to confirm the corrected label. No
    law needed. Limits stated: only the current snapshot was tested; the 315->304 drift is observed, the window
    mechanism is proved; the rest of the payload was not audited for the same defect.

